1
00:00:00,766 --> 00:00:03,496
(Raj:)So, I did a little
research on what

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:05,302
(Raj:)the conditions are like
in the mines,

3
00:00:05,304 --> 00:00:06,804
(Raj:)and the guys might be right--

4
00:00:06,806 --> 00:00:08,176
(Raj:)sounds pretty rough
down there.

5
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:10,144
(Raj:)For starters, it's very humid,

6
00:00:10,142 --> 00:00:11,972
(Raj:)and about a hundred degrees.

7
00:00:11,977 --> 00:00:14,847
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm from Texas
and you're from India--

8
00:00:14,847 --> 00:00:18,947
(Sheldon:)we're no strangers
to the fragrant armpit. Next.

9
00:00:18,951 --> 00:00:22,621
(Raj:)It's also a live mine, so
there'll be dynamite explosions

10
00:00:22,621 --> 00:00:24,851
(Raj:)going off in the distance.
Yeah, I have

11
00:00:24,857 --> 00:00:26,787
a lactose-intolerant roommate

12
00:00:26,792 --> 00:00:29,792
(Sheldon:)with a taste
for ice cream. Next.

13
00:00:29,795 --> 00:00:32,725
(Raj:)Oh, you have to be down there
for 12 hours at a time.

14
00:00:32,731 --> 00:00:35,461
(Sheldon:)Yeah? We have to be somewhere.

15
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:36,697
(Raj:)Well, there's no toilets--

16
00:00:36,702 --> 00:00:38,472
(Raj:)we'll have to do our business
in a bucket.

17
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:41,340
(Sheldon:)So it's settled--
we're not doing it.

18
00:00:43,142 --> 00:00:45,742
(Raj:)Look, I get it, but...
before we pass up

19
00:00:45,744 --> 00:00:48,344
(Raj:)on an incredible opportunity,
I was thinking about

20
00:00:48,347 --> 00:00:50,577
(Raj:)when Howard was training
to go to space,

21
00:00:50,583 --> 00:00:52,553
(Raj:)they put him
in a simulated environment.

22
00:00:52,551 --> 00:00:55,851
(Sheldon:)Interesting. You're
suggesting that we recreate

23
00:00:55,855 --> 00:00:57,685
(Raj:)the conditions
of the mine

24
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:00,160
(Sheldon:)to see if we
can handle it.
Exactly.

